OpenSSL: encryption, signatures and certificates with the OpenSSL of
the base system. php83-openssl-legacy is the same module with the
legacy provider of OpenSSL; install one of the two.

The module openssl of PHP 8.3 for php83 of azsupport/ports, which
installs side by side with the other versions of PHP:
lib/php/20230831/openssl.so, loaded by its ini in etc/php83/conf.d, its
headers in include/php83/php/ext/openssl.
